n":"孟子曰：「伯夷，目不視惡色，耳不聽惡聲。非其君不事，非其民不使。治則進，亂則退。橫政之所出，橫民之所止，不忍居也。思與鄉人處，如以朝衣朝冠坐於塗炭也。當紂之時，居北海之濱，以待天下之清也。故聞伯夷之風者，頑夫廉，懦夫有立志。\n「伊尹曰：『何事非君？何使非民？』治亦進，亂亦進。曰：『天之生斯民也，使先知覺後知，使先覺覺後","cooccurrence":{"directed":false,"multigraph":false,"graph":{},"nodes":[{"id":"何"},{"id":"貴"},{"id":"諸"},{"id":"民"},{"id":"見"},{"id":"往"},{"id":"尊"},{"id":"侯"},{"id":"取"},{"id":"況"},{"id":"至"},{"id":"賢"},{"id":"一"},{"id":"義"},{"id":"受"},{"id":"役"}],"edges":[{"weight":0.4171611478713556,"source":"何","target":"民"},{"weight":0.84794406396381,"source":"何","target":"侯"},{"weight":0.84794406396381,"source":"何","target":"諸"},{"weight":0.84794406396381,"source":"何","target":"受"},{"weight":1.3334518797455106,"source":"何","target":"義"},{"weight":0.9279867716373463,"source":"何","target":"見"},{"weight":0.773836091810088,"source":"何","target":"往"},{"weight":2.690758703992149,"source":"貴","target":"尊"},{"weight":2.2387735802490916,"source":"貴","target":"賢"},{"weight":1.5456263996891464,"source":"貴","target":"一"},{"weight":1.864080130807681,"source":"貴","target":"義"},{"weight":2.7256459629925898,"source":"諸","target":"侯"},{"weight":2.0717194955859255,"source":"諸","target":"取"},{"weight":1.3785723150259803,"source":"諸","target":"民"},{"weight":1.60171586634019,"source":"諸","target":"義"},{"weight":1.1962507582320256,"source":"諸","target":"見"},{"weight":1.889397938791971,"source":"諸","target":"況"},{"weight":2.334083760053417,"source":"民","target":"取"},{"weight":1.170932950247736,"source":"民","target":"義"},{"weight":0.685425134466035,"source":"民","target":"侯"},{"weight":1.1962507582320256,"source":"見","target":"侯"},{"weight":1.6817585740137264,"source":"見","target":"義"},{"weight":1.8152899666382492,"source":"見","target":"往"},{"weight":1.363304842895192,"source":"見","target":"賢"},{"weight":3.607049435866304,"source":"往","target":"役"},{"weight":2.2207550747464135,"source":"往","target":"義"},{"weight":1.9976115234322036,"source":"往","target":"取"},{"weight":2.8185920755020337,"source":"尊","target":"賢"},{"weight":1.209154163067