心者，知其性也。知其性，則知天矣。存其心，養其性，所以事天也。殀壽不貳，修身以俟之，所以立命也。」\n孟子曰：「莫非命也，順受其正。是故知命者，不立乎巖牆之下。盡其道而死者，正命也。桎梏死者，非正命也。」\n孟子曰：「求則得之，舍則失之，是求有益於得也，求在我者也。求之有道，得之有命，是求無益於得也，求在外者","cooccurrence":{"directed":false,"multigraph":false,"graph":{},"nodes":[{"id":"齊"},{"id":"惡"},{"id":"長"},{"id":"在"},{"id":"窮"},{"id":"敬"},{"id":"仁"},{"id":"弗"},{"id":"受"},{"id":"禮"},{"id":"失"},{"id":"士"},{"id":"食"},{"id":"義"},{"id":"德"},{"id":"事"}],"edges":[{"weight":3.6018680771243066,"source":"齊","target":"受"},{"weight":2.5032557884561966,"source":"齊","target":"弗"},{"weight":1.992430164690206,"source":"齊","target":"義"},{"weight":1.1451323043030026,"source":"惡","target":"仁"},{"weight":2.6855773452501515,"source":"惡","target":"在"},{"weight":1.4816045409242156,"source":"惡","target":"義"},{"weight":2.908720896564361,"source":"長","target":"敬"},{"weight":1.992430164690206,"source":"長","target":"義"},{"weight":0.9628107475090479,"source":"在","target":"仁"},{"weight":1.2992829841302609,"source":"在","target":"義"},{"weight":2.2155737160044158,"source":"在","target":"禮"},{"weight":2.3978952727983707,"source":"窮","target":"士"},{"weight":3.091042453358316,"source":"窮","target":"失"},{"weight":2.3978952727983707,"source":"窮","target":"義"},{"weight":2.6210388241125804,"source":"敬","target":"禮"},{"weight":1.7047480922384253,"source":"敬","target":"義"},{"weight":1.3682758556172123,"source":"仁","target":"禮"},{"weight":1.550597412411167,"source":"仁","target":"義"},{"weight":1.3682758556172123,"source":"仁","target":"事"},{"weight":1.6559579280689933,"source":"仁","target":"弗"},{"weight":2.908720896564361,"source":"弗","target":"受"},{"weight":1.2992829841302609,"source":"弗","target":"義"},{"weight":1.992430164690206,"source":"弗","target":"食"},{"weight":2.3978952727983707,"source":"受","target":"義"},{"weight":1.7047480922384253,"source":"禮","target":"義"},{"weight":2.174751721484161,"source":"失","target":"士"},{"weight":2.174751721484161,"source":"失","target":"義"},{"weight":1.4816045409242156,"source":"士","target":"義"},{"weight":2.39789527279837